      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "- and what we need to do right now is roll out \n  that replacement pods A, B and C\n- and the question is right now, :\n    ° how are we going to do this ?",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- and what we need to do right now is roll out \n  that replacement pods A, B and C\n- and the question is right now, :\n    ° how are we going to do this ?",
