      "updated": 1793701962295,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "==> we have different strategies when it comes \n    to rolling out new versions of the Application\n    - the default is :\n        ° rolling update\n        ° the rolling update works is that :\n            1) we're firstly going to instantiate \n               a new version of the application\n            2) then add the new Pod to the Service\n            3) terminate the old one",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "==> we have different strategies when it comes \n    to rolling out new versions of the Application\n    - the default is :\n        ° rolling update\n        ° the rolling update works is that :\n            1) we're firstly going to instantiate \n               a new version of the application\n            2) then add the new Pod to the Service\n            3) terminate the old one",
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "baseline": 296,
      "index": "c2eV",
